  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "How many goals did Pelé really score?",
      "scene": {
        "hook": true,
        "bg": "green",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "pele_leap",
            "big": "?",
            "bigSize": 420,
            "bigY": 1300,
            "w": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He made his Santos debut aged fifteen, in 1956. And scored.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "green",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "pele_debut",
            "label": "SANTOS · 1956",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "AGED 15|AND SCORED",
            "hi": 1,
            "size": 170,
            "w": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He won three World Cups. 1958, 1962 and 1970.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "yellow",
        "type": "shelf",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "shelf",
            "title": "BRAZIL",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "World Cup",
                "year": "1958",
                "kind": "cup"
              },
              {
                "label": "World Cup",
                "year": "1962",
                "kind": "cup"
              },
              {
                "label": "World Cup",
                "year": "1970",
                "kind": "cup"
              }
            ],
            "w": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Guinness World Records says one thousand, two hundred and seventy-nine.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "green",
        "type": "portrait",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "portrait",
            "person": {
              "image": "pele"
            },
            "name": "PELÉ",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "counter",
            "from": 0,
            "to": 1279,
            "comma": true,
            "word": "GOALS · GUINNESS",
            "size": 340,
            "w": 4
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In one thousand, three hundred and sixty-three games, over twenty-one years.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "yellow",
        "type": "counter",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "counter",
            "from": 0,
            "to": 1363,
            "comma": true,
            "word": "GAMES",
            "size": 340,
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "years",
            "items": [
              {
                "year": "1956",
                "top": "FIRST",
                "label": "Aged 15",
                "tick": true,
                "head": "#1ea85a"
              },
              {
                "year": "1977",
                "top": "LAST",
                "label": "New York Cosmos",
                "tick": true,
                "head": "#1ea85a"
              }
            ],
            "w": 8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "His thousandth came on the nineteenth of November, 1969, at the Maracanã.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "counter",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "counter",
            "prop": "calendar",
            "top": "NOVEMBER 1969",
            "from": 1,
            "to": 19,
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "maracana1969",
            "label": "THE MARACANÃ",
            "w": 11
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A penalty, against Vasco da Gama, in front of around eighty thousand fans.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "maracana1969",
            "big": "1,000",
            "bigSize": 300,
            "bigY": 1250,
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "PENALTY|v VASCO DA GAMA",
            "hi": 1,
            "size": 150,
            "w": 3
          },
          {
            "type": "counter",
            "from": 0,
            "to": 80000,
            "comma": true,
            "word": "FANS",
            "size": 300,
            "w": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He dedicated it to the poor children of Brazil.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "pele_mics",
            "label": "“FOR THE CHILDREN”",
            "w": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "How did it get so big? In 1959 alone, he scored a hundred and twenty-seven.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "green",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "pele_leap",
            "label": "SANTOS · 1959",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "counter",
            "from": 0,
            "to": 127,
            "word": "GOALS IN 1959",
            "size": 420,
            "w": 12
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "But here's the catch.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "red",
        "type": "statement",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "THE CATCH",
            "hi": 0,
            "size": 220,
            "w": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "That total counts friendlies, exhibition games and world tours too.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "red",
        "type": "statement",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "FRIENDLIES|EXHIBITIONS|TOURS",
            "hi": -1,
            "size": 150,
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "santos_tour",
            "label": "SANTOS ON TOUR",
            "w": 7
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Count only official matches, and it drops to around seven hundred and sixty.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "red",
        "type": "counter",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "counter",
            "from": 1279,
            "to": 760,
            "comma": true,
            "word": "OFFICIAL GOALS",
            "size": 340,
            "fmt": "~{v}",
            "w": 6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "That's over five hundred goals, gone.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "red",
        "type": "statement",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "500+|GOALS GONE",
            "hi": 0,
            "size": 150,
            "w": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And that changes who football's top scorer is.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "purple",
        "type": "portrait",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "portrait",
            "person": {
              "image": "pele"
            },
            "name": "TOP SCORER?",
            "w": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Because in September 2024, Cristiano Ronaldo became the first man to score nine hundred official goals.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "purple",
        "type": "counter",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "counter",
            "prop": "calendar",
            "top": "SEPTEMBER 2024",
            "from": 1,
            "to": 5,
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "portrait",
            "person": {
              "image": "ronaldo"
            },
            "name": "CRISTIANO RONALDO",
            "w": 4
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "ronaldo_900",
            "big": "900",
            "bigSize": 380,
            "bigY": 1250,
            "w": 12
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So who's the top scorer? Count everything, it's Pelé. Count only official games, it's Ronaldo.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "purple",
        "type": "statement",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "WHO'S|TOP?",
            "hi": 1,
            "size": 160,
            "w": 0
          },
          {
